WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
As expected of someone who could hurt Meng Feifan

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,680
It's really extraordinary

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,480
I know why you came to Liu's house

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,320
But that old guy just wants to be convinced

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,520
If you are looking for Liu Qiong, you might as well look for me.

6
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,120
Help me take over the Liu family

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,720
I will focus on power

8
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,480
A person who can even stab his own father with a knife

9
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,480
Who dares to believe

10
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,920
That’s not what you said, little brother

11
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:21,190
Liu Feng can scheme against the Liu family to this extent

12
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,350
It's a skill in itself

13
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:24,750
The person who just spoke

14
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,750
It's Jie's father who helped his sister-in-law and aunt Sanniang

15
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:27,910
This is my elder brother

16
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,710
Father Jie helps his sister-in-law and aunt Sanniang

17
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,510
Shen Kui, leader of Jie’s Father Gang

18
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:33,470
A martial artist who bullies the poor just like you

19
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,470
You and I join forces

20
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,510
After the trial

21
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,550
Use your power to help Ms. Lu win over the enemy

22
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,550
What do you think is good?

23
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,710
I cooperate with you

24
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:55,420
I'm in charge of everything

25
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:05,550
Do you think we didn’t arrange it?

26
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:08,670
Recently, the zhenqi in the array has been unable to circulate.

27
00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:09,590
here

28
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,830
You're just an ordinary martial artist in terms of attack power.
